---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
import banner from "../assets/banner.png";

const crumbs = [
  { name: "Home", path: "/" },
  { name: "Our firm", path: "/about" },
];
---

<Base
  title="About Devine Plumbing and Heating"
  description="Darren runs Devine Plumbing and Heating. Open 24 hours, local to Bedfordshire, map pin near Edenham. 5.0 from 13 Google reviews. Call 07436 135412."
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <div class="wrap page-hero prose">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Our firm</p>
    <h1>Our firm</h1>
    <p>
      Devine Plumbing and Heating is Darren’s plumbing business. Customers on Google use his first
      name, and the owner replies match. We do not add a surname here, because the profile does not
      print one.
    </p>
  </div>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:1rem">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>What the profile says</h2>
        <p>{SITE.googleDescription}</p>
        <p>
          That sentence is the firm’s own text on Google. Under it, the listing is a plumber, open
          24 hours, with the phone {SITE.phoneDisplay}. Google also marks it LGBTQ+ friendly. There
          is no website, no email address, and no street address on the listing.
        </p>
        <p>
          The map pin is near Edenham, South Kesteven, Lincolnshire, by Four Mile Riding and
          Grimsthorpe. That is not a shop. Reviews describe Darren coming to the house: on time, for
          a boiler, a fire, a leak, a Friday night flood.
        </p>
        <h2>What customers repeat</h2>
        <p>
          James has used him for a couple of years. Laura has used him for a combi boiler, breakdowns
          and routine visits. Joanna kept his number. Mark said the gas fire job was clean. Nick said
          he stayed to fix a stopcock he could have walked past.
        </p>
        <p>
          The score on 8 October 2026 was 5.0 from 13 reviews. Five of those reviews are quoted on
          the <a href="/reviews">reviews page</a>. The rest are on the Google profile.
        </p>
        <h2>Gas Safe</h2>
        <p>
          The firm’s own Google image says “Gas Safe registered”. James wrote that Darren is on the
          register. The registration number is not on the profile, so it is not on this site. Ask to
          see the Gas Safe card when work starts. That card is the check that matters.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a class="btn" href={SITE.tel}>Call {SITE.phoneDisplay}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="media">
        <Image
          src={banner}
          alt="Devine Plumbing and Heating banner from Google, with the phone number 07436135412"
          widths={[480, 800, 1200]}
          sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 50vw"
        />
        <figcaption class="caption">Banner image from the Google profile.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
